  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiation Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this Initiation Plan is to provide preparatory assistance to the drafting of a Project Document on &#x201C;Effective Planning and Financing for Sustainable and Inclusive Development&#x201D; and to allow mobilization of resources. The project initiation Plan (PIP) will support national capacity in the development of sectoral and provincial implementation plans and mainstreaming including monitoring of the SDGs. Effort will be directed towards supporting coordination structures in the preparation and reporting on SDGs and NSEDP Building on activities already underway, the initiation plan will allow finalization and operationalization of the SDG indicator framework and development of the SDG baseline report.</narrative>
  </description>
